             class="adoption-stat-img" loading="lazy" />
    </a>

    <h2>BTCVPS.com — VPS hosting</h2>
    <p>
        <a href="https://btcvps.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored">BTCVPS.com</a>
        is a crypto-native VPS host that lets customers pay in a spread of coins — BTC, XMR, LTC,
        DASH, DGB. This is their payment breakdown by crypto for <strong>June 2026, and Monero is
        in the lead: XMR at 46.8%</strong>, ahead of Bitcoin at 38.1%. Litecoin (8.7%), Dash
        (5.6%), and DigiByte (0.8%) make up the rest. Note the customer base here isn't a
        privacy-first niche — it's people buying servers who could pay in any of five coins — and
        the plurality still reach for Monero over Bitcoin. Another hosting provider, another month
        where XMR out-earns BTC.
    </p>
    <a href="/images/btcvps.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="adoption-stat-link">
        <img src="/images/btcvps.jpg"
             alt="BTCVPS.com June 2026 payment breakdown by crypto: XMR 46.8%, BTC 38.1%, LTC 8.7%, DASH 5.6%, DGB 0.8%"
